  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference deep learning variant caller for DNA sequencing — 3.7k stars, 25 releases, v1.10.0 (March 2026), actively maintained by Google Health. Supports all major sequencing platforms (Illumina, PacBio, ONT). Won the 2020 PrecisionFDA Truth Challenge V2. BSD-3-Clause, Docker-containerised, GPU/TPU-accelerated. Part of Google's genomics infrastructure that has collectively processed exomes and whole genomes of 2.5 million individuals globally. Adopt for any genomics pipeline requiring high-accuracy variant calling.",
